cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Virelion CardioScore, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Virelion CardioScore: CiPA-aligned cardiotoxicity scoring for iPSC-CM MEA data"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-16"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Virelion-Biotech/Virelion-CardioScore"
authors:
  - name: "Virelion Biotech"
    website: "https://github.com/Virelion-Biotech"
abstract: >
  Open-source Python framework for automated, transparent, CiPA-oriented
  cardiotoxicity risk scoring from human iPSC-derived cardiomyocyte
  microelectrode array field-potential recordings. Designed for early
  preclinical screening of vaccines, antitoxins, antivirals, and other
  therapeutic modalities.
keywords:
  - cardiotoxicity
  - iPSC-CM
  - MEA
  - CiPA
  - field potential
  - drug safety
  - electrophysiology
